      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hi, I'm just reviewing our HACCP plan for the new catering contract. Can you give me the specific temperature and time requirements we need to follow for cooling down cooked poultry? I need to make sure we're hitting the right targets to stop Clostridium perfringens from growing during the cooling phase.",
