    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for that. just to be safe, can you go into more detail about why that specific window is so critical for clostridium perfringens? like, what's actually happening at the microscopic level during that period to cause issues? i want to explain the risk to the kitchen staff so they take it seriously.",
